@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Login

actor User
participant LoginFrame
participant AuthService
participant UserRepository
database H2

User -> LoginFrame: Enter username/password
LoginFrame -> AuthService: login(username, password)
AuthService -> UserRepository: findByUsername(username)
UserRepository -> H2: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username=?
H2 --> UserRepository: User row
UserRepository --> AuthService: User entity
AuthService -> AuthService: Verify password hash
alt Password valid
    AuthService --> LoginFrame: User object
    LoginFrame --> User: Show MainFrame
else Password invalid
    AuthService --> LoginFrame: AuthenticationException
    LoginFrame --> User: Show error
end
@enduml